  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience for this meme is primarily internet users familiar with the 'Alright Girls! Smiiiiile' meme format, particularly those who engage with or create content that mocks or pressures non-Western individuals to conform to Western standards of emotional expression. The meme is designed to elicit humor through the juxtaposition of the girls' genuine or neutral expressions with the exaggerated demand to smile, appealing to viewers who find such performative or cultural appropriation-based humor amusing. The audience likely includes individuals who are aware of the meme's history and its underlying misogynistic and culturally insensitive undertones, and who may be drawn to its ironic or satirical nature, even if they are not directly part of the community being depicted.",
